b_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shift - Power Slide</li><li>Right Mouse - Grapple</li><li>B - rewind to checkpoint</li><li>L - rewind to start</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Exit the game?</h2>There is a transport portal outside the claw that says exit!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why no 2D Menus and UI?</h2>Less time creating boring menus = more time making fun game!",
